# Consent Location Sharing

This project is a consent-based location sharing application built with Node.js and Express. It includes:

- Secure user registration and login
- Consent-based location sharing
- Trusted contacts management
- Dashboard for location history
- Privacy-first design

## Features

- User login and registration
- Geolocation capture only after explicit user consent
- Trusted contact list with phone/email fields
- Dashboard with stats and location history
- Stop-sharing button
- Local session-based authentication

## Tech Stack

- Node.js
- Express
- Express Session
- bcryptjs
- HTML/CSS/JavaScript

## Getting Started

```bash
npm install
npm start
```

Open the app in your browser:

```bash
http://localhost:3000
```

## Important Notice

This app is designed for lawful, consent-based sharing only. It does not collect location silently, and it requires explicit user approval before geolocation is used.

